    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d201">

                <pb facs="0273" n="191" sameAs="frus:frus1865p3/pg191"/>

                <head>Mr. Campbell to Mr. Seward</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 11.]</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">Legation of the United States,</hi>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Stockholm,</hi></placeName>
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1865-01-09"><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >January</hi> 9, 1865.</date></dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir:</hi> I have the honor to enclose a reply to my
                    note of the 2d instant, addressed to Count Manderstrom, minister of state and of
                    foreign affairs, in relation to the recent visit of the United States steamer
                    Wachusett to the island of St. Bartholomew.</p>
                <p>A copy of the reply and of the translation thereof are herewith enclosed.</p>
                <p>I have the honor to be, sir, your obedient servant,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>JAMES H. CAMPBELL.</signed></closer>
                <postscript>
                    <p>Hon. <hi rendition="#small-caps">William H. Seward,</hi>
                        <hi rendition="#italic">&amp;c., &amp;c., &amp;c.</hi></p>
                </postscript>


                <xi:include href="d201-a1.xml" xpointer="d201-a1"/>
            </div>
